WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,780
The little guy's feet are actually a little hard

2
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:04,380
Feels really good

3
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:06,640
It's not impossible

4
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:09,840
You can redeem points by putting the gold box into the entrance of the machine.

5
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:15,680
There are two thousand points here

6
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:16,800
Enough for you to live for a long time

7
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,240
You can also eat a lot of delicious food

8
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:20,000
This is your 101 room card

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,260
I'm thirsty

10
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,740
Can I exchange it for water?

11
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:24,780
Of course

12
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:26,620
Just swipe it with your points card

13
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:34,080
Is there any food at the machine next to it?

14
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:36,000
There are two left in the breakfast machine today.

15
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,520
Egg pot pancake and sauce pancake

16
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:38,560
which one do you want

17
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:41,300
I want it all

18
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:42,580
I have two thousand points

19
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:46,620
I'm going back to my room, right?

20
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:48,300
There will be a breakfast room on the second floor tomorrow morning

21
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:49,500
Open from 5 to 8 p.m.

22
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,980
If you want to have breakfast, you can go upstairs and buy it. Okay.
